import Scott1982.Theorem72

/-!
# Solution to the Challenge

The declaration `theorem_7_2` of `Challenge.lean`, proved in
`Theorem72.lean`. Wording is the first sentence of Theorem 7.2 in Scott 1982
(`sources/Domains_for_Denotational_Semantics.pdf`): approximable maps
`A → B` are exactly the elements of the Definition 7.1 function-space
system `|A → B|`. Importing the sorry-free development supplies the
compared definitions with the same names and types as in the Challenge
module.
-/
